1
00:00:00,754 --> 00:00:04,354
(Sheldon:)I always looked up
to you and Pop-Pop.

2
00:00:04,358 --> 00:00:06,628
I-I know what
a challenging man he could be,

3
00:00:06,627 --> 00:00:09,967
(Sheldon:)but I saw you stand
by him and-and make him

4
00:00:09,964 --> 00:00:11,564
(Sheldon:)into a better person.

5
00:00:11,565 --> 00:00:12,595
(Sheldon:)I did.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,700
(Sheldon:)Yeah, well, that is exactly

7
00:00:13,701 --> 00:00:15,671
(Sheldon:)what I've been doing
the last five years

8
00:00:15,669 --> 00:00:17,899
(Sheldon:)with this little
work in progress.

9
00:00:20,674 --> 00:00:22,874
(Leonard:)He never disappoints,
does he?

10
00:00:24,044 --> 00:00:27,084
(Amy:)I think what Sheldon means
to say is

11
00:00:27,081 --> 00:00:29,281
(Amy:)we've both grown together.

12
00:00:29,283 --> 00:00:30,353
(Amy:)Isn't that right?

13
00:00:30,351 --> 00:00:31,751
(Sheldon:)Well...

14
00:00:31,752 --> 00:00:32,222
(Penny:)Say yes.

15
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:33,589
(Penny:)Yes.

16
00:00:33,587 --> 00:00:34,987
MEEMAW:
Fine.

17
00:00:34,989 --> 00:00:38,689
(Meemaw:)If you feel so strongly,
I won't stand in your way.

18
00:00:38,692 --> 00:00:39,922
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

19
00:00:39,927 --> 00:00:41,027
(Amy:)So if he wanted

20
00:00:41,028 --> 00:00:43,228
(Amy:)to give me
that engagement ring,

21
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,260
(Amy:)we would have your blessing?

22
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:47,266
(Meemaw:)I suppose.

23
00:00:52,573 --> 00:00:54,143
(Sheldon:)I just gave you
my virginity, woman.

24
00:00:54,141 --> 00:00:55,871
(Sheldon:)Cool your jets.

25
00:01:03,790 --> 00:01:06,690
(Raj:)Yeah, see, if you
just change the story

26
00:01:06,693 --> 00:01:08,823
(Raj:)to the destruction
of our galaxy,

27
00:01:08,829 --> 00:01:11,329
(Raj:)then a super massive
black hole could work.

28
00:01:11,331 --> 00:01:12,901
(Claire:)This is great.

29
00:01:12,899 --> 00:01:15,169
(Claire:)Thank you so much.

30
00:01:15,168 --> 00:01:17,068
(Claire:)I just got to figure out
a way for everyone

31
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:19,740
(Claire:)to die that isn't too scary
for children.

32
00:01:21,375 --> 00:01:25,175
(Raj:)And that's how
Mommy and Daddy met.

33
00:01:26,646 --> 00:01:28,946
(Claire:)Hey, did you ever tell Emily
about us?

34
00:01:28,949 --> 00:01:30,419
I will!

